'''''Stutzerimonas chloritidismutans''''' is a [[Gram-negative bacteria|Gram-negative]], rod-shaped, [[facultative anaerobic organism|facultatively anaerobic]] bacterium in the family [[Pseudomonadaceae]]. It performs dissimilatory [[chlorate]] reduction but does not carry out [[denitrification]].<ref name="Wolterink2002">{{cite journal
